        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Damazti Cluster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_650_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "What are you looking at?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Logos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_426_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "At your King of Sarkaz, Banshee.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Damazti Cluster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_650_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're facing Amiya.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Logos"
    },
    {
        "text": "I advise you to carefully consider your actions.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Logos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_426_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "And you should do away with the curses in your hands.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Damazti Cluster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_426_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Relax. They've already won.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Damazti Cluster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_650_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm grateful for our earlier exchanges, Damazti. I have a clearer understanding of your methods now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Logos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_426_1#9$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "The King of Sarkaz couldn't have possibly lost to our clone that had already been fried near to a crisp by a Draco's flames.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Damazti Cluster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_426_1#9$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "But we are glad to have experienced something new for the first time in such a long time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Damazti Cluster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_426_1#9$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's been ages since we've seen anything that has brought us even a speck of excitement.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Damazti Cluster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_426_1#9$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Be proud of yourself, Banshee. You've convinced us, and we'll be more than happy to keep this new possibility of yours, though we're still not very optimistic about the direction this possibility is heading.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Damazti Cluster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_426_1#9$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "But to us, time and patience are two things we have more than plenty of.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Damazti Cluster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_426_1#9$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "We <i>will</i> meet again, at the next finish line.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Damazti Cluster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_650_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Where are you going next?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Logos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_426_1#4$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "We've never gone anywhere on purpose, we merely wander the land.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Damazti Cluster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_650_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You've mentioned before, Damazti, that you've pretty much exhausted all possibilities.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Logos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_426_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Damazti Cluster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_650_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "But there remains uncharted territory for you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Logos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_426_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Oh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Damazti Cluster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_650_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Everything on this great land is constantly evolving, while you stayed just as you always have been, imitating the fruits of evolution.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Logos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_650_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, you've never gone anywhere, and yet you're already complete.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Logos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_650_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "So of course there can be no progress in something that's already been completed.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Logos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_426_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "How persuasively provocative. And what do you suggest?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Damazti Cluster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_650_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You've already guessed it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Logos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_426_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Damazti Cluster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_426_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Heralding our deaths\u2014you do live up to your name, bean s\u00ed.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Damazti Cluster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_650_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "From death comes new life.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Logos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_426_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Indeed, we've never tried this before...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Damazti Cluster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_426_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Damazti Cluster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_426_1#4$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "We just bid goodbye to a friend, at a place not far from here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Damazti Cluster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_426_1#4$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "She said that she would rather give up living than to let life wash over her.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Damazti Cluster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_426_1#4$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "We felt her emotions, we saw her determination.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Damazti Cluster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_426_1#4$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "She claimed it was the choice of a coward, but we felt something else.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Damazti Cluster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_426_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "We could barely put it in words then, but now we know, that it also took a certain kind of courage.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Damazti Cluster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_426_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "The kind of courage we've never considered before.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Damazti Cluster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_426_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Well, alright. Banshee, we admit it",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Damazti Cluster"
    },
    {
        "text": "We've begun looking forward to this.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Damazti Cluster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_426_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "This might be just an innocuous scheme of yours, a clumsy method of ridding yourself of an enemy.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Damazti Cluster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_426_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "But that doesn't matter to us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Damazti Cluster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_426_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Or maybe the souls are merely borrowing your voice to provoke us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Damazti Cluster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_650_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Need me to help you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Logos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_426_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "How about you leave us with some decency?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Damazti Cluster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_426_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Though you ought to sound the death knell for us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Damazti Cluster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
