        "focus": "m",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Damazti Cluster"
    },
    {
        "text": "You sure are a tenacious and brave bunch. Celebrate your victory.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Damazti Cluster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_426_1#9$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "This can't be your full power.",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_426_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "What, are you not entertained, Doctor of Rhodes Island?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Damazti Cluster"
    },
    {
        "text": "Or maybe that's unnecessary? Maybe we actually understand you on a... level beyond your worst estimates?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Damazti Cluster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_426_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "I trust Rhodes Island's security systems.;......;Do you also have a clone on Rhodes Island?",
        "values": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_426_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Haha, relax, Doctor. Your ship's onboarding inspection is not as easy as it seems to slip through.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Damazti Cluster"
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright. Goodbye, all.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Damazti Cluster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_395_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "What are you planning?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ascalon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_426_1#4$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "What else can we do with our broken body?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Damazti Cluster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_426_1#4$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "We've stayed in our original form for... long enough.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Damazti Cluster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_humanchange",
        "volume": 0.3
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
