    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Tiny King of Sarkaz, where will you go next?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Damazti Cluster"
    },
    {
        "text": "Where will you bring these people who trust you, follow you, protect you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Damazti Cluster"
    },
    {
        "text": "Will you do as Buldrokkas'tee prophesized, and enslave everything across all the lands...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Damazti Cluster"
    },
    {
        "text": "Or will you prove that it is only us who have been bound too deeply by the chains of history?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Damazti Cluster"
    },
    {
        "text": "'Evolution,' a tricky word indeed, implying an inevitable progress, though it may not be.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Damazti Cluster"
    },
    {
        "text": "But no matter, you will find your path, and us as well.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Damazti Cluster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "image"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_battlefield",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_394_1#11$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "He dissipated...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_395_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, the Damazti won't die. His other, more complete and stronger self, is probably just around the corner.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ascalon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_395_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is a typical tactic of his, to have the prey let down its guard, and then come in for the kill...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ascalon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_boneflute"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 3
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_395_1#4$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "A bone whistle? How can this be?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ascalon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_395_1#4$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Logos sees the bone whistle as a lamentable tradition of the Royal Court, and has always refused to sound it as his predecessors have done.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ascalon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_395_1#10$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "But this is indeed a bone whistle from the Master of Knells.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ascalon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_395_1#4$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ascalon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_395_1#4$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Damazti cluster... is dying.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ascalon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "'The elegy has sounded, the bone whistle done wailing.'",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "'I serve as a witness to a Sarkaz, the Damazti, and his cluster.'",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "'From death comes new life.'",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_victoria",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_055",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "A bone whistle.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Confessarius"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_055",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "How long has it been since we've had the Lord of the Banshees grace our court to sound the bone whistle?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Confessarius"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_062",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_062",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Damazti Cluster has died.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_055",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Fret not, the Damazti has only encountered a minor setback, he'll soon...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Confessarius"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_062",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, what I mean is, every Damazti fragment is simultaneously decaying.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_062",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Damazti dies, and our long-lasting Royal Court will collapse.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_062",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmph, how interesting.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_062",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I think, that he himself never imagined that it would end like this.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_062",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "How should I describe it? A split into halves?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_062",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Or the birth of two new lives?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "37_g11_wsafehouse",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "The ancient Damazti no longer exists.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "And two newborn Damazti have appeared in this world.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sand in nature is regarded as the final state of all things. No matter how strong a boulder may be, it turns to dust at the end of time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "But then again, the sand may also hold the possibility of starting a cycle of reincarnation anew.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_411_1#4$1",
        "focus": "m",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Kal'tsit, your wounds are still healing, move another inch and I'll tell Shining\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Closure"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm already fine, for the most part.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "An old friend might locate us soon... no, I should say a new friend now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_411_1#12$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't want to meet any of your old or new friends.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Closure"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_411_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "There's good news and bad news, pick one?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Closure"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_411_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wait, I sure am tired. Why did I think you would be up for a stupid game?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Closure"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_411_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "The bad news is\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Closure"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Give me the good news.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_411_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "The bad news is that we didn't find the entrance to the Sarkaz supply route in Brentwood. There was no underground tunnel at all, but there was a passage used for inspections...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Closure"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_411_1#5$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wait, you... huh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Closure"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I said, give me the good news.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_411_1#4$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah... um, I...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Closure"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_411_1#4$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Shining\u2014!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Closure"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I like to hear positive news sometimes as well, Closure.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_411_1#5$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Closure"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_411_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "The good news is, we managed to get in touch with the Doctor.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Closure"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "34_g11_hispdwarshipdeck",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_394_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Thank you for your assistance, Duke Windermere. We've managed to re-establish our communication channels.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_866_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "The refugees we brought have all boarded the ship, and they'll be under the Duke of Windermere's protection for the time being.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Delphine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_868_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I should be the one thanking you, Rhodes Island.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Duke of Windermere"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_868_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You've helped the townspeople of Norport Borough escape a disaster. Not all of them, but... it's enough.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Duke of Windermere"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_868_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Protecting the people is what we, those who bear the title of duke, ought to do.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Duke of Windermere"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_868_1#9$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "And, you even saved my daughter.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Duke of Windermere"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_868_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "She was just bawling in her room earlier.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Duke of Windermere"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_866_1#5$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mum! I was only...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Delphine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_868_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I can guess what you've all been through the last couple of days.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Duke of Windermere"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_868_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "But Delphine, perhaps you have come to better understand how those in power should wield authority.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Duke of Windermere"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_396_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "If I may be so bold, Your Grace, how are you planning to use your power?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dagda"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_396_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "After witnessing the fate of the Steam Knights, I'm not sure\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dagda"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_868_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I had to make a strategic decision, daughter of Montague.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Duke of Windermere"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_868_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You may call it a plot, and I won't deny that I signed my name on the Steam Knights' orders.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Duke of Windermere"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_868_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "But... to decide the future of this country is exactly our duty.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Duke of Windermere"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avgnew_112_siege_1#5$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...'Duty'.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_868_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, Miss Vina. 'Duty'.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Duke of Windermere"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_868_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You understand why I'm addressing you that way.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Duke of Windermere"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avgnew_112_siege_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you'd excuse us, Your Grace. For now, I would... rather be with my friends.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_868_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "As you please.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Duke of Windermere"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_396_1#6$1",
        "focus": "all"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avgnew_112_siege_1#1$1",
        "focus": "all"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_868_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Now then, Doctor of Rhodes Island. I believe... we can't avoid discussing the object your operator is carrying.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Duke of Windermere"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_868_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "Kyngasycath.;......;It's just a tourist trinket.",
        "values": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_868_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I knew it wasn't my imagination.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Duke of Windermere"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_868_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "That is Victoria's Realmblade, yes?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Duke of Windermere"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 3
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_868_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Delphine was praising you so highly that perhaps I require a re-evaluation.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Duke of Windermere"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_868_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Anyway, it's impossible to ignore her and the sword she's carrying.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Duke of Windermere"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_868_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Delphine told me about your deal with her. Even though there were some twists and turns in between, I'm sure that deal remains valid.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Duke of Windermere"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_868_1#7$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "Don't tell me you're becoming a supporter of Rhodes Island.",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_868_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Duke of Windermere"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_868_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "But I promise you that for now, I'll act as if nothing happened.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Duke of Windermere"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_868_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "We can talk this out slowly when we've returned to my demesne.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Duke of Windermere"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "34_g11_hispdwarshipdeck",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_405_1#5$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Cador didn't get on the ship, he left with a bunch of people.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Morgan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avgnew_112_siege_1#5$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "And Hannah?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_405_1#3$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "She's still in her room and refuses to come out.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Morgan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avgnew_112_siege_1#9$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let's get her something to eat. She's barely had a decent meal in Norport.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_405_1#3$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yeah.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Morgan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avgnew_112_siege_1#5$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "What are you burning?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_405_1#13$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "A bunch of drafts.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Morgan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_405_1#13$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Notes I saved for writing inspiration.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Morgan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_405_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "But I forgot where I dropped my memoir notebook, haha.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Morgan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_405_1#3$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Siege, you don't need it, do you? We don't need it anymore.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Morgan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avgnew_112_siege_1#9$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sure.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "text": "I...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_396_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Siege, what's... are you crying?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dagda"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avgnew_112_siege_1#12$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, I just...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "text": "I just...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avgnew_112_siege_1#9$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Heavy tears roll down Siege's cheeks, while Morgan and Dagda are both stunned in their common consensus\u2014Vina has never shed a tear before."
    },
    {
        "text": "On the deck of this high-speed battleship, the Victorian sun is still slowly rising, sweeping the haze and evaporating the mist from last night."
    },
    {
        "text": "And this youth called Vina, with her back to the sun, is expressing her emotions without a word."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avgnew_112_siege_1#9$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I just... got ash in my eyes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_405_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Norport will return to her old self, the people are still there after all.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Morgan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_405_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "We'll get our old lives back... eventually.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Morgan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_405_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "We just... need patience. A little more of it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Morgan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_405_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Vina, I\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Morgan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_405_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "The war is going to end, right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Morgan"
    },
